<title>DEMOCRATIC REPUBLIC OF CONGO: SOCCER-TANZANIA AND CONGO DRAW 1-1 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TANZANIA AND CONGO DRAW 1-1 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tanzania Congo drew 1-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in their group six African Nations Cup qualifier</p>
<p>on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scoers:</p>
<p>Tanzania - Youssef 12</p>
<p>Democratic Republic of the Congo - Kidoda 90 pen</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
</text>
